{"fps": 30, "dur": 20.68, "lead": 0.4, "lines": [{"spk": "ella", "a": 0.553, "b": 2.479, "text": "Oye... ¿tú sabes qué día es hoy?", "words": [{"w": "Oye...", "a": 0.553, "b": 1.28}, {"w": "¿tú", "a": 1.2930000000000001, "b": 1.3599999999999999}, {"w": "sabes", "a": 1.42, "b": 1.6800000000000002}, {"w": "qué", "a": 1.7200000000000002, "b": 1.8399999999999999}, {"w": "día", "a": 1.9, "b": 2.08}, {"w": "es", "a": 2.133, "b": 2.24}, {"w": "hoy?", "a": 2.28, "b": 2.479}]}, {"spk": "el", "a": 3.428, "b": 3.999, "text": "...Martes.", "words": [{"w": "...Martes.", "a": 3.428, "b": 3.999}]}, {"spk": "ella", "a": 4.6930000000000005, "b": 6.24, "text": "Ajá. ¿Y qué más?", "words": [{"w": "Ajá.", "a": 4.6930000000000005, "b": 4.96}, {"w": "¿Y", "a": 5.12, "b": 5.5200000000000005}, {"w": "qué", "a": 5.6000000000000005, "b": 5.840000000000001}, {"w": "más?", "a": 5.9, "b": 6.24}]}, {"spk": "el", "a": 7.168, "b": 9.042, "text": "Martes... importante.", "words": [{"w": "Martes...", "a": 7.168, "b": 7.763000000000001}, {"w": "importante.", "a": 7.871, "b": 9.042}]}, {"spk": "ella", "a": 10.06, "b": 12.002, "text": "Hoy hace un año que vivimos juntos.", "words": [{"w": "Hoy", "a": 10.06, "b": 10.082}, {"w": "hace", "a": 10.13, "b": 10.322000000000001}, {"w": "un", "a": 10.349, "b": 10.402000000000001}, {"w": "año", "a": 10.462, "b": 10.642000000000001}, {"w": "que", "a": 10.702, "b": 10.882}, {"w": "vivimos", "a": 10.942, "b": 11.362}, {"w": "juntos.", "a": 11.402000000000001, "b": 12.002}]}, {"spk": "el", "a": 12.939, "b": 14.482000000000001, "text": "Ya. Por eso digo importante.", "words": [{"w": "Ya.", "a": 12.939, "b": 13.162}, {"w": "Por", "a": 13.212, "b": 13.362}, {"w": "eso", "a": 13.422, "b": 13.602}, {"w": "digo", "a": 13.642000000000001, "b": 13.763}, {"w": "importante.", "a": 13.82, "b": 14.482000000000001}]}, {"spk": "ella", "a": 15.117, "b": 17.201999999999998, "text": "¿Ah, sí? ¿Y qué me has comprado?", "words": [{"w": "¿Ah,", "a": 15.117, "b": 15.402000000000001}, {"